module strategy.compute_fabric_model

import std.nat { Nat }
import std.bool { Bool }
import strategy.strategy_model { EvidenceAnchor }

data compute_fabric_model_note: String = "Distributed-physical-compute-fabric kernel seed, v6 (physical aggregation -> derivation+fabrication -> carrier+dependency -> service-boundary -> contamination/access/storage -> maintenance-locality/network-burden directives, all docs/strategy/2026-08-10-*). Shape-search before minting: extdeps.chassis/extdeps.power own hardware catalog rows; strategy.site_model owns the site-admission/business layer; the spatial foundation is a SEPARATE pending model per the spatial-world-kernel directive scope ruling. This file introduces only the fabric-domain relations no existing authority owns: physical functions and per-consumer demands, candidate realizations with exact demand discharge, the carrier/support split, the power and storage service decompositions, the physical dependency ledger, compute assemblies, service domains, site compute admission, fabrication/printed-part discipline, comparison axes, and witness obligations. SEED-FORM DEBTS, recorded not silent: (1) no witness carrier - the ten first-witness obligations plus twelve power and eight storage acceptance controls are recorded, not discharged; (2) every realization row is hypothesis-grade until fixture receipts land; (3) public-repo authority references (asrock_altrad8ud_1l2t_catalog, altra_max_m12830_catalog, dynatron_w1_catalog, fleet_intent) are review-asserted and pending pin-verification - this session holds only the private overlay; (4) seasonal/diverted heat rejection remains a missing shape; (5) external readings (UL printed-part variability, HDT bands, ASHRAE contamination, EPA MERV, NIST physical-security families, SIA OSDP, OCP ORv3, ASRock direct-12V) pending pin-verification per the extdeps discipline; (6) the twelve contamination and access demand rows have exact consumers but NO admitted realizations yet - they are IncompletePhysicalDesign until candidates and dependency edges land; (7) three StorageDemand/StorageBinding pairs are now instantiated (boot, scratch, artifact) with their NetworkServiceDemands; the remaining E8 matrix rows (caches, runner images, tenant-private, logs) are the authoring queue; (8) no OperatorInterventionProfile or LocalScratchServiceability row is instantiated yet - each realization owes one before comparison; (9) every numeric note in the network demands is ILLUSTRATIVE ARITHMETIC or explicitly unmeasured, never an observation."

data derivation_stance_note: String = "OPERATOR RULING (2026-08-10; aggregation-directive annotation A0, ratified twice since): boundaries are DERIVED, never subtracted. We begin with the actual requirements of the selected software, hardware, people, and site; physical things enter the design only when a requirement derives them. A chassis-shaped boundary may appear if several demands resolve most efficiently at that one boundary. The default is NO UNEARNED MATTER - and (carrier+dependency directive) NO UNEARNED RELATIONSHIP: a custom bracket, interface, connector, coolant branch, rail, control path, or site penetration must justify not just its material existence but the maintenance obligation it creates. Pipeline: selected software and operational plan -> exact physical demands -> external physics/standards/product facts -> explicit safety/habitability/business ceilings -> candidate realizations -> admitted physical design -> generated BOM and build instructions -> as-built observations. The BOM is the output, never where reasoning begins."

data explanatory_ownership_note: String = "DOCTRINE (derivation+fabrication directive, adopted): physical ownership means EXPLANATORY ownership, not fabrication ownership. Every physical artifact must be traceable to an active requirement, an externally grounded constraint, or an explicitly budgeted human/aesthetic objective. Every item requires a traceable reason; NOT every item requires an original design - a commodity PSU may be the derived answer; an aluminum extrusion may be the cheapest grounded load path; a standard bolt is consumed as a standardized atom, never re-proved per assembly - the extdeps discipline applied to matter. CommodityPurchase, AdditiveManufacture, SheetFabrication, Machining, and Reuse are PEER realizations: no method privileged, cheapest admissible wins across all funded axes. Additive corollary: PRINT THE BESPOKE INTERFACE, NOT THE IRREDUCIBLE SAFETY BOUNDARY - promotion into load/heat/fire/electrical/fluid-critical roles only by test or appropriate authority."

data dependency_law_note: String = "LAW (carrier+dependency directive, adopted): a realization does not merely discharge demands - it also CREATES dependencies. Selection compares the discharged demands against the dependencies introduced over the full expected lifetime. A chassis, rack, cassette, CDU, custom shroud, printed jig, special connector, and wall anchor each create different dependency populations; every custom physical relationship is a dependency we must inventory, maintain, reproduce, qualify, and eventually retire or migrate. Custom-dependency ADMISSION RULE - admitted only when at least one holds: (1) no commodity realization satisfies the active demand; (2) it removes more lifecycle dependency burden than it creates; (3) it creates a measured improvement on a funded axis large enough to justify its maintenance; (4) it is a bounded experiment with an explicit retirement decision. A one-off is fine when consciously one-off; it must never invisibly become fleet architecture."

data no_inherited_boundary_law: String = "No two service domains are assumed equal merely because a rack normally makes them equal, and no sharing boundary is inherited from the 19-inch rack, the vendor chassis, or any market convention unless a measured requirement justifies it. Coincidence of boundaries is chosen on receipts or it is a defect. Corollary: alignment between physical service domains and software drain domains is deliberate in both directions - deliberately aligned, or deliberately not aligned, never accidental."

data spatial_obligations_note: String = "Relations OWED TO the pending spatial-world kernel, consumed (not minted) here: MountedTo (assembly, surface, pose, attachment, load), RequiresClearance, PhysicalRoute (power/network/air/fluid/drain), PotentialFlow (airflow/heat/fluid-leak/smoke), and SpatialVolumeContainsAssembly / AssemblyMountedToSurface, of which rack residence is one specialization. This carrier binds assemblies to demands, carriers, supports, realizations, domains, and dependency edges only."

