  | ElectromagneticContainment
  | FireDetection
  | FirePropagationResistance
  | DustControl
  | AmbientClimate
  | PhysicalAccessControl
  | ServiceAccess
  | VisualIntegration
  | EmergencyDisconnect
  | WorkloadRecovery

data physical_function_note: String = "Functions are NEEDS, not parts. The aggregation directive's minimum-local-boundary table is the requirement inventory these arms carry; the null hypothesis for every function is no local boundary. VisualIntegration is first-class, not decoration: a named consumer and budget (section 0 habitability increment ~$3-8k/site). Cork and similar finishes are admitted realizations of VisualIntegration / information surfaces and REFUSED as StructuralSupport or load path - the structural layer remains metal."

