}

data physical_function_demand_note: String = "Each selected consumer EMITS exact requirement instances - the layer that prevents replacing the vendor-chassis monolith with a hand-authored package monolith. A demand with no consumer is not a demand. STANDING GAP, recorded per the carrier+dependency review: only two seed demands exist (Jade airflow, site visual integration); no instantiated demands yet for structural support, component retention, service access, mains/low-voltage touch protection, emergency disconnect, grounding, leak routing, or physical access control - therefore every drawn artifact in the concept sheets is a CANDIDATE, not an earned part, until its exact demand and ceiling rows land."

