data candidate_discharge_note: String = "Discharge claims are EXACT: one candidate x one demand x expected outcome x evidence. The earlier satisfies_functions: List<PhysicalFunction> is retired - a generic 'satisfies StructuralSupport' crossed over every structural demand is the physical analogue of the IAM cross-product overgranting defect. A candidate may discharge several demands; each discharge is its own row."

