data physical_dependency_edge_note: String = "A dependency is recorded PER EXACT RELATIONSHIP, never as a generic product note. Every custom dependency must answer: what creates it, what consumes it, who can reproduce it, what files/tools/materials reproduce it, how long reproduction takes, what breaks if it disappears, what alternative replaces it, how we remove it, what remains damaged or site-coupled afterward, and when it dissolves."

type DependencyLifecycle {
